        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**KitchenHub** is a full-screen, tiling dashboard for a wall-mounted kitchen iPad.\n\nThe screen is a 12x8 grid; each panel snaps to whole cells and can be moved or resized in edit mode, and the layout persists between launches.\n\n- Grid engine with move / resize / snap and JSON-persisted layout\n- Clock and Timer panels, with more on the way\n- Long-press-gated edit mode so cooking never rearranges the board\n- Designed to be locked on-screen with the Kiosk Mode tweak\n\nRequires iPadOS 16+ and **AppSync Unified**."
        },
